Capital Records and ESPN link up for a 2018 NBA Cypher featuring District, Albee Al, JAG &amp; Ras Kass. This is perfect timing for this Priority Record artists during the biggest event weekend during the NBA season. Millions of eyes watching All-Star Weekend in Los Angeles this past weekend. The commercial was aired throughout the weekend for the world to see giving Capital Records, Priority Records, ESPN, and the artists an opportunity to showcase their talents. The Cypher allows ESPN and everyone involved the opportunity to bridge the cap and possibly a new platform to allow artists to showcase their musical talents on a regular basis. if this is the case I love what all side are trying to accomplish and I applaud each side for trying to think outside of the box with this collaboration. The classic Sportscenter instrumental is the icing on the cake for me personally and I would like to give a personal shout out to Jag for his hard work and dedication to his craft.

